      "message": "Hi Diana and Abe,\ncan you take a look at this CL. It addresses a remaining comment from crrev/c/3602226 and fixes a bug I found in the landed CL to add a Status response.\n\nBasically, the check for Get_Status was right next to Get_Battery_Status in the extended message request sections of pe_src/snk_ready_run. It should have been in the control message sections, otherwise the EC just responds to Get_Status with Not_Supported, as it did before the CL. I re-validated the status response on a twinkie with this CL and it is working correctly. Let me know if you have any questions.",
